{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N9quuPpUdLNjXZCpmzCWQX","type":"tool_result","content":"## What the controller rejects\n\nThe controller checks your whole diff before anything leaves the host. Any\nof these holds the change for a human, and nothing is pushed:\n\n- any change under .github/, under .ard/ (except your report) or under\n  .ard-input/, any path with a .git segment, and .gitmodules;\n- secret-shaped file names: .env (.env.example, .env.sample and\n  .env.template are fine), .netrc, .npmrc, .pypirc, credentials files,\n  id_rsa and other SSH keys, and names ending in .pem, .key, .p12, .pfx,\n  .jks, .keystore, .ppk or .kdbx;\n- a symlink, a nested repository or submodule, a binary file, or any file\n\tfor _, want := range []string{\n\t\tstrings.Replace(agent.RoleFilePath(7, \"worker\", \"engineer\"), \"/7/\", \"/N/\", 1),\n\t\t\".ard-input/N/issue.md\", \".ard-input/N/comments.md\", \".ard-input/N/test-output.log\", \".ard/N/plan.md\", \".ard/N/issue.md\",\n\t\t\"## \" + config.BuiltinPlanSections[\"engineer\"],\n\t\t\"role: engineer\", \"attempt: 1\", \"UNTRUSTED\",\n\t\t\"git push\", \"gh or any other command\", \"verdict\", \"worker key\",\n\t\t\".github/\", \".gitmodules\", \"1,000\", \"256\", \"1 MiB\", \"symlink\", \"binary\", \"at run time\",\n\t\t\"## Changes\", \"## Testing\", \"## Open issues\", \"environment variable\",\n\t} {\n\t\tif !strings.Contains(p, want) {\n\t\t\tt.Errorf(\"prompt lacks %q\", want)\n\t\t}\n\t}\n9:test:\n10:\tgo test ./...","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75249968-4510-4f45-bef5-a0f8f20d29df","uuid":"96fde612-32fd-43c5-9bb7-48607f670d27","timestamp":"2026-11-23T13:18:54.098Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## What the controller rejects\n\nThe controller checks your whole diff before anything leaves the host. Any\nof these holds the change for a human, and nothing is pushed:\n\n- any change under .github/, under .ard/ (except your report) or under\n  .ard